{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Let's meet under the cherry blossom tree again this year.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a story that brings animals and plants together in the fleeting springtime of the woods.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recall the days you spent playing in the wild mountains until the sun went down...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430090/extras/4d2fc197416027a04d08b2f564ffeae4.poster.avif?t=1759753186\" width=816 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430090/extras/4d2fc197416027a04d08b2f564ffeae4.webm?t=1759753186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430090/extras/4d2fc197416027a04d08b2f564ffeae4.mp4?t=1759753186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second episode of the Satoyama series depicting life in the woods and the critters who spend their days there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanuki the raccoon dog gets a letter from Kitsune the fox and skips to the mountain to enjoy the flowers with his friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A point-and-click game where you head through the forest to find a cherry blossom tree, talking to animals and identifying many plants on the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430090/extras/76e8de22b690513121f5fa156a309809.poster.avif?t=1759753186\" width=1102 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430090/extras/76e8de22b690513121f5fa156a309809.webm?t=1759753186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430090/extras/76e8de22b690513121f5fa156a309809.mp4?t=1759753186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple point-and-click controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story depicting life in the woods of Japan and the critters who spend their days there</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm world hand-painted in ink</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A field guide to refer to for identifying plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful music played on the shinobue, a Japanese bamboo flute, and handcrafted sound effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tanuki and Kitsune</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430090/extras/935acdc4d5fa021e2dfc261e54a76106.avif?t=1759753186\" width=500 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animals and plants</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430090/extras/6ebc6f3f583252096ce240cd1d257d13.avif?t=1759753186\" width=500 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may post gameplay videos and stream gameplay of Satoyama Note: Spring Walk under the condition that you include a link to the game's website or store page, so that more people can enjoy the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima